Q: C++ Challenge: Maximum unique reserved words in one logical line of code? A: <p>The following code tries to pack the maximum of keywords for <strong>C++23</strong> in a minimum of code, keeping the original basic structure of a function <em>declaration</em> (no code actually generated).</p>
<p>In C++23 I counted <strong>91</strong> keywords. A few of them are missing in the snippet:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>asm</code> is implementation defined</li>
<li><code>register</code> is forbidden since C++17</li>
<li><code>co_await</code> <code>co_return</code> and <code>co_yield</code> are possible but require coroutine definition</li>
<li><code>export</code> must use module</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://godbolt.org/z/EqbYjz9an" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Online demo</a></p>
<pre><code>#include &lt;typeinfo&gt;
namespace {
template&lt;typename&gt; concept _ = requires() { false; };
class alignas(8) A { private:protected:public:friend struct B; virtual void f() { extern decltype(this) a; } explicit operator char() {} };
static constexpr inline void __(
    int* = const_cast&lt;int*&gt;(reinterpret_cast&lt;int*&gt;(0)),
    void* = static_cast&lt;long*&gt;(dynamic_cast&lt;void*&gt;(reinterpret_cast&lt;std::bad_cast*&gt;(0))),
    bool = not nullptr or true and alignof(char16_t),
    const auto&amp; = typeid(signed),
    short = [] mutable {
        struct B{};
        try { throw 0; } catch (...) {}
        do { using _ = double; } while (0); for (;;) continue; 
        switch (0) { typedef unsigned _; case 0:default: break; }
        if consteval{} else {delete new float;}
        static_assert(sizeof(char8_t));  union {}; enum {};  
        constinit volatile thread_local char32_t _; ((_ and_eq 0) xor_eq 0) or_eq 0; goto _; _: return 0; }(),
    wchar_t = 0 bitand 0 bitor compl 0 xor 0 not_eq 0) noexcept;
    // missing; asm register  export co_await co_return co_yield
}
</code></pre>

Q: Last resort/catch-all/fallback template overload A: <p>I don't think it can be done without <code>enable_if</code> (or c++20 <code>requires</code>, but it can be done pretty transparently.</p>
<p>Starting from the well-known &quot;overload&quot; trick to combine several functor/lambda classes in c++17</p>
<pre class="lang-cpp prettyprint-override"><code>template&lt;class... Ts&gt; struct overload : Ts... { using Ts::operator()...; };
template&lt;class... Ts&gt; overload(Ts...) -&gt; overload&lt;Ts...&gt;;
</code></pre>
<p>We can of course add one more &quot;last resort&quot; fallback</p>
<pre class="lang-cpp prettyprint-override"><code>std::variant&lt;int,double,const char *&gt; v = 42;

std::visit(overload{
    [](double d) { /* handle doubles */ }
    [](auto &amp;&amp;) { /* ignore everything else */ }
}, v)
</code></pre>
<p>But this will have the drawback that a template can always be instantiated as an exact match, so now you won't get any of the possible conversions during overload selection - they'll all go to the perfect-match &quot;last-resort&quot; instead of the overload they <em>could</em> have gone do it it wasn't there. E.g. that int{42} could easily have been accepted in the <code>double</code> overload, but it'll go to the <code>auto &amp;&amp;</code> branch instead.</p>
<p>But we could also move that &quot;last resort&quot; template into the class itself, defining it as a real template instead of a lambda, and now we can see the types of the other <code>Ts...</code> and use enable_if to specifically accept only cases they <strong>can't</strong>:</p>
<pre><code>template&lt;class... Ts&gt; struct incomplete_overload : Ts... { 
    using Ts::operator()...;
    // a &quot;last resort&quot; no-op that will ignore any types the Ts... didn't to handle
    template&lt;typename T, typename = std::enable_if_t&lt;(!std::is_invocable_v&lt;Ts, T&gt; &amp;&amp; ...)&gt;&gt; void operator()(T&amp;&amp;) {}
};
</code></pre>
<p>So now anything which could go to one of the Ts (by some legal decay/conversion path) will do so.</p>
<p>Or, the syntax is a little cleaner using c++20 concept checks, but the idea is the same:</p>
<pre><code>template&lt;class... Ts&gt; struct incomplete_overload : Ts... { 
    using Ts::operator()...;
    // a &quot;last resort&quot; no-op that will ignore any types the Ts... didn't to handle
    template&lt;typename T&gt; void operator()(T&amp;&amp;) requires (!std::invocable&lt;Ts, T&gt; &amp;&amp; ...) { }
};
</code></pre>

Q: localhost:8000 keeps on loading without any error or proper output A: <p>&lt;?php</p>
<p>session_start();</p>
<p>$usuarios = [];</p>
<p>if(isset($_SESSION['usuario'])){</p>
<pre><code>$usuarios\[\] = $\_SESSION\['usuario'\];
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>// Cadastro</p>
<p>if(isset($_POST['cadastrar'])){</p>
<pre><code>$nome = $\_POST\['nome'\];

$email = $\_POST\['email'\];

$senha = $\_POST\['senha'\];

$plano = $\_POST\['plano'\];



$\_SESSION\['usuario'\] = \[

    'nome' =\&gt; $nome,

    'email' =\&gt; $email,

    'senha' =\&gt; password_hash($senha, PASSWORD_DEFAULT),

    'plano' =\&gt; $plano,

    'pago' =\&gt; false

\];

$sucesso = &quot;Cadastro feito! Agora faça login.&quot;;
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>// Login</p>
<p>if(isset($_POST['entrar'])){</p>
<pre><code>$email = $\_POST\['email'\];

$senha = $\_POST\['senha'\];

if(isset($\_SESSION\['usuario'\]) &amp;&amp; $\_SESSION\['usuario'\]\['email'\] == $email &amp;&amp; password_verify($senha, $\_SESSION\['usuario'\]\['senha'\])){

    $\_SESSION\['logado'\] = true;

    header(&quot;Location: ?pagina=jogos&quot;);

    exit;

} else {

    $erro = &quot;Dados errados ou não cadastrado!&quot;;

}
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>// Pagar</p>
<p>if(isset($_POST['pagar'])){</p>
<pre><code>$\_SESSION\['usuario'\]\['pago'\] = true;

header(&quot;Location: ?pagina=jogos&quot;);

exit;
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>// Sair</p>
<p>if(isset($_GET['sair'])){</p>
<pre><code>session_destroy();

header(&quot;Location: index.php&quot;);

exit;
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>$pagina = $_GET['pagina'] ?? 'inicio';</p>
<p>?&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;html lang=&quot;pt-br&quot;&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;head&gt;</p>
<pre><code>\&lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;\&gt;

\&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;\&gt;

\&lt;title\&gt;Teste Site Jogos\&lt;/title\&gt;

\&lt;style\&gt;

    \*{margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; font-family: Arial;}

    body{background:#1a1a2e; color:#fff; padding:20px;}

    .container{max-width:500px; margin:0 auto;}

    .bloco{background:#16213e; padding:25px; border-radius:12px; margin:15px 0;}

    input, select, button{width:100%; padding:12px; margin:8px 0; border-radius:6px; border:none; font-size:1rem;}

    button{background:#00f5d4; color:#000; font-weight:bold; cursor:pointer;}

    .vermelho{color:#ff4d4d;}

    .verde{color:#4dff88;}

    .jogo{background:#0f3460; padding:15px; border-radius:8px; margin:10px 0; text-align:center;}

\&lt;/style\&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>&lt;/head&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;body&gt;</p>
<pre><code>\&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;\&gt;

    \&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:center; color:#00f5d4; margin-bottom:20px;&quot;\&gt;🎮 TESTE FUNCIONAL\&lt;/h1\&gt;

    \&lt;?php if(isset($erro)) echo &quot;\&lt;div class='bloco vermelho'\&gt;$erro\&lt;/div\&gt;&quot;; ?\&gt;

    \&lt;?php if(isset($sucesso)) echo &quot;\&lt;div class='bloco verde'\&gt;$sucesso\&lt;/div\&gt;&quot;; ?\&gt;

    \&lt;?php if($pagina == 'inicio'): ?\&gt;

        \&lt;!-- CADASTRO --\&gt;

        \&lt;div class=&quot;bloco&quot;\&gt;

            \&lt;h2\&gt;📝 Cadastre-se\&lt;/h2\&gt;

            \&lt;form method=&quot;POST&quot;\&gt;

                \&lt;input type=&quot;text&quot; name=&quot;nome&quot; placeholder=&quot;Seu nome&quot; required\&gt;

                \&lt;input type=&quot;email&quot; name=&quot;email&quot; placeholder=&quot;Seu e-mail&quot; required\&gt;

                \&lt;input type=&quot;password&quot; name=&quot;senha&quot; placeholder=&quot;Crie uma senha&quot; required\&gt;

                \&lt;select name=&quot;plano&quot; required\&gt;

                    \&lt;option value=&quot;mensal&quot;\&gt;Mensal R$19,90\&lt;/option\&gt;

                    \&lt;option value=&quot;anual&quot;\&gt;Anual R$99,90\&lt;/option\&gt;

                \&lt;/select\&gt;

                \&lt;button type=&quot;submit&quot; name=&quot;cadastrar&quot;\&gt;Cadastrar\&lt;/button\&gt;

            \&lt;/form\&gt;

        \&lt;/div\&gt;

        \&lt;!-- LOGIN --\&gt;

        \&lt;div class=&quot;bloco&quot;\&gt;

            \&lt;h2\&gt;🔐 Entrar\&lt;/h2\&gt;

            \&lt;form method=&quot;POST&quot;\&gt;

                \&lt;input type=&quot;email&quot; name=&quot;email&quot; placeholder=&quot;Seu e-mail&quot; required\&gt;

                \&lt;input type=&quot;password&quot; name=&quot;senha&quot; placeholder=&quot;Sua senha&quot; required\&gt;

                \&lt;button type=&quot;submit&quot; name=&quot;entrar&quot;\&gt;Entrar\&lt;/button\&gt;

            \&lt;/form\&gt;

        \&lt;/div\&gt;

    \&lt;?php elseif($pagina == 'jogos' &amp;&amp; isset($\_SESSION\['logado'\])): ?\&gt;

        \&lt;div class=&quot;bloco&quot; style=&quot;display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;&quot;\&gt;

            \&lt;h2\&gt;Olá, \&lt;?=$\_SESSION\['usuario'\]\['nome'\]?\&gt;\&lt;/h2\&gt;

            \&lt;a href=&quot;?sair=1&quot; style=&quot;color:#ff4d4d; text-decoration:none;&quot;\&gt;Sair\&lt;/a\&gt;

        \&lt;/div\&gt;

        \&lt;?php if($\_SESSION\['usuario'\]\['pago'\] === false): ?\&gt;

            \&lt;div class=&quot;bloco vermelho&quot;\&gt;

                \&lt;h3\&gt;⚠️ Pagamento pendente\&lt;/h3\&gt;

                \&lt;p\&gt;Você precisa pagar para ver os jogos\&lt;/p\&gt;

                \&lt;form method=&quot;POST&quot;\&gt;

                    \&lt;button type=&quot;submit&quot; name=&quot;pagar&quot;\&gt;💳 SIMULAR PAGAMENTO (CLIQUE AQUI)\&lt;/button\&gt;

                \&lt;/form\&gt;

            \&lt;/div\&gt;

        \&lt;?php else: ?\&gt;

            \&lt;div class=&quot;bloco verde&quot;\&gt;✅ PAGO - ACESSO LIBERADO\&lt;/div\&gt;

            \&lt;div class=&quot;jogo&quot;\&gt;

                \&lt;h3\&gt;🏎️ Corrida 3D\&lt;/h3\&gt;

                \&lt;p\&gt;Jogo funcionando perfeitamente!\&lt;/p\&gt;

            \&lt;/div\&gt;

            \&lt;div class=&quot;jogo&quot;\&gt;

                \&lt;h3\&gt;🎯 Tiro ao Alvo\&lt;/h3\&gt;

                \&lt;p\&gt;Tudo operacional!\&lt;/p\&gt;

            \&lt;/div\&gt;

        \&lt;?php endif; ?\&gt;

    \&lt;?php else: ?\&gt;

        \&lt;div class=&quot;bloco vermelho&quot;\&gt;

            \&lt;h2\&gt;Acesso negado!\&lt;/h2\&gt;

            \&lt;p\&gt;Você precisa fazer login primeiro.\&lt;/p\&gt;



         \&lt;a href=&quot;index.php&quot; style=&quot;color:#00f5d4;&quot;\&gt;Voltar\&lt;/a\&gt;

        \&lt;/div\&gt;

    \&lt;?php endif; ?\&gt;

\&lt;/div\&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>&lt;/body&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;/html&gt;</p>
